'''Death Angel Z-Onel''' (死霊妖精クオリネム ''Shiryō Yōsei Kuorinemu'', '''Death Fairy Kuolinem''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] introduced in the [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Z-Onel Rises!]]. She was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

