}}

==Enemy==
Death Angel Z-Onel has subpar health compared to other Merciless [[:Category:Advent Bosses|Advent Bosses]], at a mere 1,000,000, and has an even larger blindspot compared to her [[Cruel Angel Clionel|Angelic counterpart]]. However, there are several aspects that drastically escalate her threat - she spawns multiple times in several of her appearances (twice in [[Last of the Dead (Merciless)|Last of the Dead]]/[[The Final Corpse (Merciless)|The Final Corpse]], three times in [[With Sympathy (Merciless)|With Sympathy]]) , she's slow enough for her buffed support to demolish your attackers before her Long Distance attacks finish you off with a freeze. The icing on the cake is her revival, which brings her back at a whopping 50% HP 0.5 seconds after defeat. This makes her one of the of the most difficult Advent bosses to confront in the entire game, and especially so without a high-leveled [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to whittle her down and finish her off.

